# Build artifacts from `newm2 build cocoademos/*.mod`.
# The compiled binary is written next to each source. On macOS it has NO file
# extension (e.g. `plasma`, `raymarch`, `galaxigans`), so a `*.exe`/`*.obj` rule
# can't catch it. So: ignore everything here except sources + assets — this covers
# the macOS bare-name binaries and the Windows *.exe/*.obj/*.pdb/... leftovers alike.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.mod
!*.def
!*.md
!*.mid
!*.wav
!*.tcl
